config.menu.name.ModernMite=ModernMITE
config.menu.comment.ModernMite=ModernMITE client, server, and bug-fix options.

config.tab.client_tweaks=Client Features
config.tab.client_tweaks.comment=Client-side features and behavior settings.
config.tab.client_fixes=Client Fixes
config.tab.client_fixes.comment=Client-side fix toggles.
config.tab.hotkeys=Hotkeys
config.tab.hotkeys.comment=Shortcut settings for the configuration screen.
config.tab.server_fixes=Server Fixes
config.tab.server_fixes.comment=Server-side fix toggles.

config.name.modernmite.imBlocker=Input Method Fix
config.comment.modernmite.imBlocker=Automatically activate or deactivate the input method based on text-field focus.

config.name.modernmite.forceEnableInputMethodGuiScreens=Class paths of those screens needs activating the IM(Chinese)
config.comment.modernmite.forceEnableInputMethodGuiScreens=Fully qualified GUI class names that should force the input method on, one per entry.

config.name.modernmite.slashIM=Slash Activates IM
config.comment.modernmite.slashIM=Also activate the input method while entering slash-prefixed chat commands.

config.name.modernmite.noSpamLog=No Spam Log
config.comment.modernmite.noSpamLog=Disable initialization of MITE's extra loggers.

config.name.modernmite.noAttackDump=No Attack Dump
config.comment.modernmite.noAttackDump=Wont dump the report when attacking entities with Ctrl pressed

config.name.modernmite.sprintingMode=Sprinting Mode
config.comment.modernmite.sprintingMode=Choose whether sprinting is held or toggled.
config.enum.modernmite.sprintingMode.Press=Press
config.enum.modernmite.sprintingMode.Toggle=Toggle

config.name.modernmite.noReferenceFile=No Reference File
config.comment.modernmite.noReferenceFile=The files in MITE/reference.

config.name.modernmite.vanillaChat=Vanilla Chat
config.comment.modernmite.vanillaChat=Opens the chat gui to pause player behavior and no longer locks the mouse pointer

config.name.modernmite.modChangeWarning=Mod Change Warning
config.comment.modernmite.modChangeWarning=Show a warning when loading an existing world after the mod list changes.

config.name.modernmite.blockMiteWebRequests=Block MITE Website Requests
config.comment.modernmite.blockMiteWebRequests=Block requests to minecraft-is-too-easy.com and related browser redirects to avoid antivirus false positives.

config.name.modernmite.resourceLocationFix=Resource Location Fix
config.comment.modernmite.resourceLocationFix=Skip null resource locations during validation to prevent a null pointer exception.

config.name.modernmite.craftingSpeedFix=Crafting Speed Fix
config.comment.modernmite.craftingSpeedFix=Clamp the crafting period to at least 25 to prevent excessively fast crafting.

config.name.modernmite.packet24Fix=Packet 24 Fix
config.comment.modernmite.packet24Fix=Cancel handling of entity spawn packets for unknown entity types to prevent a client crash.

config.name.modernmite.worldLoadingInputFix=World Loading Click-Through Fix
config.comment.modernmite.worldLoadingInputFix=Show the terrain loading screen before joining a singleplayer world to prevent clicks made during loading from activating main-menu buttons and quitting the game.

config.name.modernmite.openWindow=Open Configuration Screen
config.comment.modernmite.openWindow=Hotkey that opens the ModernMITE configuration screen.

config.name.modernmite.devCurseFix=Development-Mode Curse Fix
config.comment.modernmite.devCurseFix=Prevent the Cannot Drink curse from being forced in development mode.

config.name.modernmite.craftingKickFix=Crafting Disconnect Fix
config.comment.modernmite.craftingKickFix=Cancel result pickup when the crafting result is null to prevent the related disconnect.

config.name.modernmite.boatFallDamageFix=Boat Fall Damage Fix
config.comment.modernmite.boatFallDamageFix=Prevent fall damage while riding a boat.

config.name.modernmite.spiderNpeFix=Spider Null Pointer Fix
config.comment.modernmite.spiderNpeFix=Prevent a null raycast result from causing a null pointer exception during spider updates.

config.name.modernmite.netherStarFix=Nether Star Explosion Immunity
config.comment.modernmite.netherStarFix=Make dropped Nether Stars immune to explosions.

config.name.modernmite.explosionDropFix=Explosion Drop Crash Fix
config.comment.modernmite.explosionDropFix=Fix crashes when explosions destroy dropped anvils, preserving their damage and custom names.

config.name.modernmite.deathMessageFix=Death Message Translation Fix
config.comment.modernmite.deathMessageFix=Fix incomplete death-message translations on multiplayer servers.

